flowchart TD
    A[You have a tuple t] --> B{Does t have any elements?}
    B -->|No, empty tuple ()| C[Hashable\nSafe as dict key or set member]
    B -->|Yes| D[Check each element one by one]
    D --> E{Is this element itself\nhashable? e.g. int, str, bool,\nfrozenset, another all-hashable tuple}
    E -->|Yes| F{More elements to check?}
    E -->|No, e.g. list, dict, set found| G[NOT Hashable\nTypeError if used as dict key\nor added to a set]
    F -->|Yes| D
    F -->|No, all checked and passed| C
